# ============================================================
#  NYXUS - wallpaper rotation set  (ALIEN THEME ONLY)
#  ~/.config/nyxus/wall-rotation.list
#  Curated 2026-07-21; re-cut 2026-07-30 to the measured urban-alien style
#  spec ONLY (see HANDOFF: near-black frame, blue->violet->magenta arc).
#  Dropped that day: graffiti-space (pop-art collage), demon (not an alien),
#  rot-black-void (99.8% pure black). Hacker-mode art is
#  reserved for actual hacker-mode (not ambient rotation) — see nyxus-hacker-mode.
#  Still excluded: kageryu dragon, sierengowski brand, void-vortex, cinematic packs.
#  One slug per line; resolves in ~/.config/hypr/walls[/rotation]
#  or /usr/share/backgrounds/nyxus. Comment a line to drop it.
# ============================================================

